{{!
    @template tool_vae/ai_page

    The page of the reformulation aid, below its heading: the policy of the site and its form; or the confirmation (the
    warning that it is shown again, the reminder, where the text goes, how long it is, what is kept, why it cannot be sent)
    and its form; or the result (the proposal next to the original, or why there is none) and the way back. A field and its
    label touch, and so do the hidden fields, the button and the way out: those line breaks are carried by comments.

    Every text comes from the context, worded by tool_vae\output\ai_page. The template holds no logic. The texts are escaped
    (double braces), the proposal and the text of the vaeiste first. Five keys are HTML (triple braces): againhtml, errorhtml
    and problemhtml, notifications of the core ($output->notification(), message escaped by tool_vae\output\ai_page);
    headinghtml, a heading of the core ($output->heading()); policyhtml, the policy of the site (format_text() of the core).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none (tool_vae/submit_once finds the form by its action, ai.php)

    Context variables required for this template:
    * againhtml - false, or HTML: what was confirmed changed, it is shown again
    * errorhtml - false, or HTML: why there is no proposal
    * headinghtml - false, or HTML: the heading of the screen
    * policyhtml - false, or HTML: the policy of the site
    * confirm - false, or an object {reminder, where, count, logged}
    * problemhtml - false, or HTML: why the text cannot be sent
    * proposal - false, or an object {notice, field}: field is an object {label, text, id}
    * original - false, or an object {field, hint, backurl, backwords}: the text of the vaeiste and the way back
    * form - false, or an object {action, hidden, field, button, backurl, backwords, hint}: hidden is an array of objects
      {name, value}; button is false or an object {label}

    Example context (json):
    {
        "againhtml": false,
        "errorhtml": false,
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Check what will be sent</h3>",
        "policyhtml": false,
        "confirm": {"reminder": "Name nobody.", "where": "To Provider.", "count": "10 characters.", "logged": "It is kept."},
        "problemhtml": false,
        "proposal": false,
        "original": false,
        "form": {
            "action": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/ai.php",
            "hidden": [{"name": "source", "value": "section"}, {"name": "step", "value": "send"}],
            "field": {"label": "Your text", "text": "My text.", "id": "tool-vae-ai-text"},
            "button": {"label": "Send this text to Provider"},
            "backurl": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/section.php",
            "backwords": "Back",
            "hint": "The page saved nothing."
        }
    }
}}
{{#againhtml}}
{{{againhtml}}}
{{/againhtml}}
{{#errorhtml}}
{{{errorhtml}}}
{{/errorhtml}}
{{#headinghtml}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{/headinghtml}}
{{#policyhtml}}
<div class="ai-policy-display">{{{policyhtml}}}</div>
{{/policyhtml}}
{{#confirm}}
<div class="alert alert-info tool-vae-anonymise" role="note">{{reminder}}</div>
<p>{{where}}</p>
<p>{{count}}</p>
<p>{{logged}}</p>
{{/confirm}}
{{#problemhtml}}
{{{problemhtml}}}
{{/problemhtml}}
{{#proposal}}
<div class="alert alert-warning" role="note">{{notice}}</div>
{{#field}}<label for="{{id}}" class="font-weight-bold">{{label}}</label>{{!
}}<textarea id="{{id}}" readonly="readonly" rows="12" class="form-control mb-2">{{text}}</textarea>{{/field}}{{/proposal}}{{!
}}{{#original}}{{#field}}<label for="{{id}}" class="font-weight-bold">{{label}}</label>{{!
}}<textarea id="{{id}}" readonly="readonly" rows="12" class="form-control mb-2">{{text}}</textarea>{{/field}}
<p class="text-muted small">{{hint}}</p>
<p><a href="{{backurl}}" class="btn btn-secondary">{{backwords}}</a></p>
{{/original}}
{{#form}}
<form method="post" action="{{action}}">{{#hidden}}<input type="hidden" name="{{name}}" value="{{value}}">{{/hidden}}{{!
}}{{#field}}<label for="{{id}}" class="font-weight-bold">{{label}}</label>{{!
}}<textarea id="{{id}}" readonly="readonly" rows="12" class="form-control mb-2" name="text">{{text}}</textarea>{{/field}}
<div class="mt-2">{{#button}}<input type="submit" class="btn btn-primary mr-2" value="{{label}}">{{/button}}{{!
}}<a href="{{backurl}}" class="btn btn-secondary">{{backwords}}</a></div>
<p class="text-muted small mt-2">{{hint}}</p>
</form>
{{/form}}
